OL,3,GNEWSACollapse fear cracked bridges to
OL,4,Abe demolished
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo bridges that developed cracks and
OL,7,Fwere closed off due to a risk of
OL,8,Fcollapse are to be demolished.
OL,10,FStockton Council submitted a prior
OL,11,Fnotification to its own planning
OL,12,Fdepartment to demolish the "redundant"
OL,13,FCrawford's and Black Square's bridges
OL,14,Facross the Castle Eden Walkway in
OL,15,FWynyard.
OL,17,FIt pointed to faults including deep
OL,18,Fcracks and movement which were spotted
OL,19,Fa decade ago, noting that demolition
OL,20,Fwas recommended in 2023, the Local
OL,21,FDemocracy Reporting Service said.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
