OL,3,GNEWSACollapse fear cracked bridges to
OL,4,Abe demolished
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said there was no start
OL,7,Fdate for the two-week long demolition
OL,8,Fbut it was expected to start this
OL,9,Fautumn and Castle Eden Walkway would be
OL,10,Fclosed during the work.
